 "report": {
  "translator_summary": "Operation 03 continues across Phase 2 and Phase 3. In Phase 2, the team stops Reclaimers from collecting Organic Plates and encounters an unidentified machine resembling the Gun Ark, leading Tak to suspect Marina is alive. In Phase 3, Hime Utsumiya in Hime Brain helps defend the Novis Noah against Jonathan Glenn, and Show Zama (Dunbine) with Cham Huau and Garalia Nyamhee (Bastole) unexpectedly breach into the area from Byston Well. All lines follow the established glossary, character registers, and technical constraints.",
  "rows_examined": "op03_02 rows 1-80 + op03_01 rows 60-80 context + op03_03 rows 1-30 forward context",
  "rows_examined_count": 120,
  "uncertainties": [
   "Row 6 (m6032#0): 'ヌートリア' translated as 'Nutria', the Reclaimer transport craft in Brain Powerd.",
   "Row 36 (m6032#33) and Row 44 (m6032#41): Kept 'Marina...?' with question mark per INDICE.md instructions not to reveal her identity prematurely.",
